Purpose
-------
Expose common actions without opening the drawer, preserve actual core/save/power
semantics, unify supplied branding and restore the earlier dark switch design.

Tasks
-----
[x] Accessible responsive icon dock and native 1x/2x/3x/4x controls.
[x] Persist autosave choice and retain three independent manual checkpoint slots.
[x] Safe battery-only physical off/on restart, not an instant-state reset.
[x] Theme host and actual native settings; reuse transparent supplied artwork.
[x] Larger original dark switch and finite orbiting-star LCD startup.
[x] Focused and complete release gates, actual visual and live verification.
[x] Post-deployment public guides, causal development ledger and private journal.

Acceptance criteria
-------------------
Existing manual/automatic/battery data survives; slots do not overwrite siblings.
Icons retain names/focus/touch targets and fit 320px and desktop layouts.
Speed reaches actual pinned core APIs; autosave off suppresses automatic writes.
Restart replaces the runtime only after checked battery/device persistence.
Startup appears only on actual power-on; refresh and reduced motion stay correct.

